  https://github.com/nv-tlabs/FlexiCubes

The reference implementation is licensed under the Apache License, Version
2.0. Source files adapted from that implementation must retain its applicable
copyright and license notices and must prominently state that they were
modified.

The FlexiCubes paper is:

  Tianchang Shen et al. "Flexible Isosurface Extraction for Gradient-Based
  Mesh Optimization." ACM Transactions on Graphics 42(4), 2023.
  https://doi.org/10.1145/3592430

